 |
 ---> Celebrity

Followers and following relationships form a graph.

4. Computer Networks
Computer A ----- Router ----- Computer B

Each device is a node.

Connections are edges.

5. Flight Routes
Delhi ----- Chennai
   |
Mumbai ----- Bangalore

Airports = Nodes

Flights = Edges

