Types of Graphs
1. Undirected Graph
A ------- B

Both directions are allowed.

Example:

Friendship

If A is a friend of B, then B is also a friend of A.

2. Directed Graph (Digraph)
A -------> B

Only one direction.

Example:

Instagram Follow

A follows B

B may not follow A.

3. Weighted Graph

Each edge has a cost or distance.

